 = position dans la playlist) :\n  ☐ n°1 What is Subnetting? - Subnettin
 g Mastery - Part 1 of 7 (9 min)\n  ☐ n°2 Drawing the Cheat Sheet - Subn
 etting Mastery - Part 2 of 7 (2 min)\n  ☐ n°3 How to solve ANY Subnetti
 ng Problems in 60 seconds or less - Subnetting Mastery - Part 3 of 7 (6 mi
 n)\n  ☐ n°4 Practice Examples - Subnetting Mastery - Part 4 of 7 (10 mi
 n)\n  ☐ n°5 Time-Saving Tricks for Subnetting - Subnetting Mastery - Pa
 rt 5 of 7 (9 min)\n  ☐ n°6 Subnetting in the /17 - /24 range - Subnetti
 ng Mastery - Part 6 of 7 (7 min)\n  ☐ n°7 Subnetting in the /1 - /16 ra
 nge - Subnetting Mastery - Part 7 of 7 (5 min)\n\nNoter dans lab-notes ce 
 qui a été compris\, créer 3 à 5 cartes Anki.
